ting people online sounds too much like virtual reality?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        You could meet them in real life afterwards. There's a singles night nearby next Tuesday. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:       So, I should meet a girl online first, and then take her to a bar? That doesn't sound user-friendly.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Oh Peter, you might want to reboot your love life!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le10ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le10ob11re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}